        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For example, our network, spectrum and architecture are ideally suited to small, handheld devices used for personal communications, and we have leveraged our wholesale distribution approach to provide a wide array of such personal communications services using both Iridium and partner devices.",
